{"id":5,"date":"2022-12-21T22:19:28","date_gmt":"2022-12-21T22:19:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/?page_id=5"},"modified":"2023-04-13T19:31:37","modified_gmt":"2023-04-13T19:31:37","slug":"front-page","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/","title":{"rendered":"Front Page"},"content":{"rendered":"<section class=\"front-page-banner\" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Retail_Lending_32-1.png)\">\n\n  <div class=\"container-xl h-100\">\n    <div class=\"front-page-banner-row row align-items-center justify-content-center h-100 position-relative\">\n      <div class=\"front-page-banner-col col-xl-6\">\n        <h1>Feel Good About Your Bank<sup>\u00ae<\/sup><\/h1>\n        <h2>We support our local community and every customer\u2019s personal and business finance goals.<\/h2>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"front-page-banner-col col-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"front-banner-link-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"shadow\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n\n                                          <div class=\"col-xl-6 front-banner-link d-flex flex-column\">\n                  <h2>Video Call Us<\/h2>\n                  <p>Open a new account or ask questions about your banking, loans, or anything else. We can help through Connect With Us Banking.<\/p>\n                  <div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary mt-auto mb-0\">\n                    <a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" target=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/digital-banking\/chelsealive\/\">\n                      Connect\n                      <\/a>\n                  <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                                                        <div class=\"col-xl-6 front-banner-link d-flex flex-column\">\n                  <h2>Online Banking<\/h2>\n                  <p>We make managing your accounts easier, from online bill pay and check deposit to setting alerts on spending and balances.<\/p>\n                  <div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary mt-auto mb-0\">\n                    <a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/secure.myvirtualbranch.com\/chelseagroton79583451\/SignIn.aspx\">\n                      Login\n                      <\/a>\n                  <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                          \n          <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <figure class=\"front-page-banner-divider m-0\">\n        <svg id=\"Layer_2\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 219.14\"><defs><style>.cls-1{fill:#fff;}<\/style><\/defs><g id=\"Layer_1-2\"><path class=\"cls-1\" d=\"m1336.86,103.14H103.14C46.18,103.14,0,149.31,0,206.28v12.87h1440V0c0,56.96-46.18,103.14-103.14,103.14Z\"\/><\/g><\/svg>\n      <\/figure>\n\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-constrained wp-block-group\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\">Committed to Our Customers<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">We\u2019re committed to serving the needs of every customer equally. Whether individual or business, we know that everyone has unique needs and goals. From financial wellness to sustained business growth, we work to understand your objectives and help provide the tools and guidance to get you there. We\u2019re here to help.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-4 wp-block-columns is-style-default\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center is-style-orange-bold has-x-large-font-size\">98.29%<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Customer Satisfaction<sup>*<\/sup><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center is-style-orange-bold has-x-large-font-size\">$5.5M<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">in giving since Averon Trust Foundation was founded<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center is-style-orange-bold has-x-large-font-size\">#1<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Bank Real Estate Lender in multiple cities<sup>**<\/sup><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-5 wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/\">Why Averon Trust<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><br><sup><em>*Overall Performance Score in Customer Satisfaction Surveys<br>**The Warren Group, Inc. Mortgage Marketshare Module Report- All Residentials, All Regions in multiple cities, CT Annual 2022<\/em><\/sup><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<section class=\"services-banner container\">\n  <div class=\"row services-banner-container justify-content-between\">\n    <div class=\"col-lg-6 content-column\">\n      <h3>Personal Banking<\/h3>\n      <div><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Personal Banking at Averon Trust is all about truly personal service, which means being there to help you get where you want to be. Whether you\u2019re a first-time home buyer or in need of a home equity loan, are seeking to finance your own or your child\u2019s education, looking for savings and checking accounts or CDs and IRAs, or want the latest in digital banking tools, we\u2019re here to help you reach your goals.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n            <div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary\">\n        <a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" target=\"\"\n          href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/open-an-account\/\">Open a Personal Account<\/a>\n      <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"col-lg-5 cta-column\">\n            <figure class=\"services-banner-image\">\n        <img width=\"465\" height=\"423\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/personal-banking.png\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Bank teller in purple shirt smiling at customer in pink shirt\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/personal-banking.png 465w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/personal-banking-300x273.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 465px) 100vw, 465px\" \/>\n      <\/figure>\n                  <div class=\"row row-cols-2 row-cols-md-1 row-cols-xl-2 g-3\">\n                  <div class=\"col\">\n            <div class=\"btn-service-link-wrap banking\">\n              <a class=\"wp-block-button__link btn-service\" target=\"\"\n                href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/checking\/\">Checking<\/a>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                  <div class=\"col\">\n            <div class=\"btn-service-link-wrap savings\">\n              <a class=\"wp-block-button__link btn-service\" target=\"\"\n                href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/saving\/\">Savings<\/a>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                  <div class=\"col\">\n            <div class=\"btn-service-link-wrap lending\">\n              <a class=\"wp-block-button__link btn-service\" target=\"\"\n                href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/\">Lending<\/a>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                  <div class=\"col\">\n            <div class=\"btn-service-link-wrap digital\">\n              <a class=\"wp-block-button__link btn-service\" target=\"\"\n                href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/digital-banking\/\">Digital<\/a>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n              <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n\n<section class=\"services-banner container\">\n  <div class=\"row services-banner-container justify-content-between\">\n    <div class=\"col-lg-6 content-column\">\n      <h3>Business Banking<\/h3>\n      <div><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At Averon Trust, we take a hands-on approach to growing your business for the long term, no matter your size. While we offer a wide range of commercial loan products, cash management services and advanced technology solutions, it\u2019s our Cash Management and Commercial Lending Teams \u2014 our people \u2014 that set us apart. We work to learn about your business needs and develop solutions geared specifically to meet (and exceed) your objectives.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n            <div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary\">\n        <a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" target=\"\"\n          href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/small-business\/open-an-account\/\">Open a Business Account<\/a>\n      <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"col-lg-5 cta-column\">\n            <figure class=\"services-banner-image\">\n        <img width=\"465\" height=\"422\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Home-business-banking.png\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Three people in business attire sitting around a counter drinking coffee\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Home-business-banking.png 465w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Home-business-banking-300x272.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 465px) 100vw, 465px\" \/>\n      <\/figure>\n                  <div class=\"row row-cols-2 row-cols-md-1 row-cols-xl-2 g-3\">\n                  <div class=\"col\">\n            <div class=\"btn-service-link-wrap banking\">\n              <a class=\"wp-block-button__link btn-service\" target=\"\"\n                href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/small-business\/\">Small Business<\/a>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                  <div class=\"col\">\n            <div class=\"btn-service-link-wrap savings\">\n              <a class=\"wp-block-button__link btn-service\" target=\"\"\n                href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/commercial\/\">Commercial<\/a>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                  <div class=\"col\">\n            <div class=\"btn-service-link-wrap digital\">\n              <a class=\"wp-block-button__link btn-service\" target=\"\"\n                href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/digital-banking\/\">Digital<\/a>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n              <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group is-style-help-with\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-10 wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<h2>How can we help?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you have questions about any service or product we offer at Averon Trust, just reach out. We\u2019re here to help.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" action=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/\" class=\"wp-block-search__button-outside wp-block-search__icon-button wp-block-search\"><label for=\"wp-block-search__input-8\" class=\"wp-block-search__label screen-reader-text\">Search<\/label><div class=\"wp-block-search__inside-wrapper \" ><input type=\"search\" id=\"wp-block-search__input-8\" class=\"wp-block-search__input wp-block-search__input\" name=\"s\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Help me with ..\"  required \/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"wp-block-search__button has-icon wp-element-button\"  aria-label=\"\"><svg class=\"search-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<path d=\"M13.5 6C10.5 6 8 8.5 8 11.5c0 1.1.3 2.1.9 3l-3.4 3 1 1.1 3.4-2.9c1 .9 2.2 1.4 3.6 1.4 3 0 5.5-2.5 5.5-5.5C19 8.5 16.5 6 13.5 6zm0 9.5c-2.2 0-4-1.8-4-4s1.8-4 4-4 4 1.8 4 4-1.8 4-4 4z\"><\/path>\n\t\t\t\t<\/svg><\/button><\/div><\/form><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"parallax-media-text alignwide container-md\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"media-column col-lg-6\">\n          <figure class=\"background\" data-animation=\"slide-in-bck-left\">\n        <img width=\"364\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Acorn-Graphic.png\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Acorn\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Acorn-Graphic.png 364w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Acorn-Graphic-300x260.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 364px) 100vw, 364px\" \/>\n      <\/figure>\n              <figure class=\"foreground\" data-animation=\"slide-in-bck-bl\">\n        <img width=\"548\" height=\"752\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/CGB_iBanking-Mobile-1.png\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Averon Trust online banking account open on a smartphone\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/CGB_iBanking-Mobile-1.png 548w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/CGB_iBanking-Mobile-1-219x300.png 219w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 548px) 100vw, 548px\" \/>\n      <\/figure>\n        <\/div>\n    <div class=\"content-column col-lg-6\">\n      <h2>Digital Banking<\/h2>\n      <p>No matter where you are, Averon Trust is right there with you, serving all your personal and business banking needs. Our Mobile Banking, Online Banking and Video Banking services ensure that you can do your banking from your home, phone, tablet, at any one of our video banking ATMs and anywhere else. We also offer digital payment services, like the tap-and-go Contactless Visa<sup>\u00ae<\/sup>\u00a0Debit Card, Visa<sup>\u00ae<\/sup>\u00a03-D Secure and Mobile Wallet for added convenience and protection.<\/p>\n\n          <div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n        <div class=\